#NEXUS

[ augustin2023a_fig3: Rhabdodontid time tree, root at the bottom. Rhabdodontidae, printed below the root's node dot, is kept as the root label. One three-way node: Transylvanosaurus, Pareisactus and the Rhabdodon pair leave one horizontal line. 8 tips, 1 polytomies (3 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261122). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=8;
    TAXLABELS
        Mochlodon_vorosi
        Mochlodon_suessi
        Zalmoxes_shqiperorum
        Zalmoxes_robustus
        Transylvanosaurus_platycephalus
        Pareisactus_evrostos
        Rhabdodon_priscus
        Rhabdodon_septimanicus
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE augustin2023a_fig3 = [&R] (((Mochlodon_vorosi,Mochlodon_suessi),(Zalmoxes_shqiperorum,Zalmoxes_robustus)),(Transylvanosaurus_platycephalus,Pareisactus_evrostos,(Rhabdodon_priscus,Rhabdodon_septimanicus)))Rhabdodontidae;
END;
